# A SUPPLIED initial image for the whole minion_tlb unit (B11).
#
# The TLB cache RF is aw 3, dw 69: eight 69-bit words.  Every word here is
# DISTINGUISHABLE and legal, and every one differs from the expected committed
# word 0x223600abcde ABOVE BIT 31 -- so a run that writes the expected value
# cannot be confused with the initial contents, and a gate that can only reach
# the low lanes cannot produce it either.
#
# The default is nonzero too, so a substituted zero table would be visible.
memstate v1
flops reset
mem 3 69 590295810358705651710
word 0 340282366920938463463374607431768211455
word 1 1180591620717411303424
word 2 2361183241434822606848
word 3 4722366482869645213696
word 4 9444732965739290427392
word 5 18889465931478580854784
word 6 37778931862957161709568
word 7 75557863725914323419136
